<Weblab2>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "published": true,
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2026-10-16T21:28:16.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18754,
  "properties": {
    "require_edit_to_continue": "true",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "script.js",
          "contents": "'use strict';\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Settings\n   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */\n\nconst CONFIG = {\n  // Set to false before students see it. The picker is for the curriculum writer.\n  showDestinationPicker: true,\n  defaultDestination: 'spin',\n  flashMs: 900,\n  announceDelayMs: 50\n};\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Copy\n   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */\n\nconst PARTS = ['expected', 'happened', 'where'];\n\nconst COPY = {\n  ui: {\n    loadError: 'This activity could not load. Please reload the page.',\n    fixLabel: 'Fix:',\n    clusterLabel: ({ count, total }) => `Report clarity: ${count} of ${total} parts added.`,\n    announceAdded: ({ label, headline, line }) => `${label} added. Reply: ${headline} ${line}`,\n    announceAddedWithFix: ({ label, headline, line, fix }) => `${label} added. Reply: ${headline} ${line} Fix: ${fix}`,\n    announceRemoved: ({ label, headline }) => `${label} removed. Reply: ${headline}`,\n    announceDestination: ({ picture }) => `New broken page. ${picture}`\n  },\n\n  // Reply headline by number of parts added (0 to 3).\n  levels: [\n    'I’m not sure what you mean.',\n    'I’m starting to see it, but I can’t fix it yet.',\n    'Closer. I could guess, but I might fix the wrong thing.',\n    'Found it. Here’s the fix.'\n  ],\n\n  destinations: [\n    {\n      id: 'spin',\n      label: 'Spin',\n      url: 'prizewheel.html',\n      picture: 'A sample page called Prize Wheel with a colorful wheel and a Spin button. A red marker sits in the top corner of the page.',\n      pictureWhere: 'A sample page called Prize Wheel with a colorful wheel and a Spin button. A red marker is on the Spin button.',\n      notes: {\n        expected: 'Wheel should spin',\n        happened: 'Nothing happens',\n        where: 'Spin button'\n      },\n      report: {\n        expected: 'I expected the wheel to spin and stop on a prize.',\n        happened: 'I tapped Spin and nothing happened.',\n        where: 'On the Spin button on the Prize Wheel page.'\n      },\n      reply: {\n        expected: 'You expected the wheel to spin and stop on a prize.',\n        happened: 'When you tap Spin, nothing happens.',\n        where: 'That’s the Spin button on the Prize Wheel page.'\n      },\n      fix: 'The Spin button isn’t connected to any code. Add a click listener that starts the wheel.'\n    },\n    {\n      id: 'headline',\n      label: 'Headline',\n      url: 'bakery.html',\n      picture: 'A sample page for Maple Street Bakery. The big headline is cut off at the edge, so the last words are missing. A red marker sits in the top corner of the page.',\n      pictureWhere: 'A sample page for Maple Street Bakery. The big headline is cut off at the edge, so the last words are missing. A red marker is on the headline.',\n      notes: {\n        expected: 'Whole headline shows',\n        happened: 'Words cut off',\n        where: 'Page title'\n      },\n      report: {\n        expected: 'I expected to see the whole headline.',\n        happened: 'The last words are cut off.',\n        where: 'In the title at the top of the bakery page.'\n      },\n      reply: {\n        expected: 'You expected the whole headline to show.',\n        happened: 'The last words are cut off at the edge.',\n        where: 'That’s the title at the top of the bakery page.'\n      },\n      fix: 'The title box is too narrow and hides the extra text. Make the box wider or let the text wrap.'\n    },\n    {\n      id: 'signup',\n      label: 'Sign-up',\n      url: 'readingclub.html',\n      picture: 'A sample page for a Reading Club with three book covers and a Join button. A red marker sits in the top corner of the page.',\n      pictureWhere: 'A sample page for a Reading Club with three book covers and a Join button. A red marker is on the Join button.',\n      notes: {\n        expected: 'Form should open',\n        happened: 'Nothing opens',\n        where: 'Join button'\n      },\n      report: {\n        expected: 'I expected a sign-up form to open.',\n        happened: 'I clicked Join and no form opened.',\n        where: 'On the Join button on the Reading Club page.'\n      },\n      reply: {\n        expected: 'You expected a sign-up form to open.',\n        happened: 'When you click Join, no form opens.',\n        where: 'That’s the Join button on the Reading Club page.'\n      },\n      fix: 'The Join button isn’t linked to the form. Connect them so clicking the button shows the form.'\n    },\n    {\n      id: 'console',\n      label: 'Console',\n      url: 'greeting.html',\n      picture: 'A sample page that says Hi with no name after it. Below it, a console shows a red TypeError at script.js line 12. A red marker sits in the top corner of the page.',\n      pictureWhere: 'A sample page that says Hi with no name after it. Below it, a console shows a red TypeError at script.js line 12. A red marker is on the console error.',\n      notes: {\n        expected: 'Says hi with my name',\n        happened: 'Name is blank',\n        where: 'script.js, line 12'\n      },\n      report: {\n        expected: 'I expected the page to say hi with my name.',\n        happened: 'My name is blank and there’s a console error.',\n        where: 'In the console, at script.js line 12.'\n      },\n      reply: {\n        expected: 'You expected the page to say hi with your name.',\n        happened: 'The name is blank and there’s a console error.',\n        where: 'The error points to script.js, line 12.'\n      },\n      fix: 'Line 12 reads from an element that doesn’t exist. Check that its id matches your code.'\n    }\n  ]\n};\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------------\n   State and element references\n   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */\n\nconst state = {\n  destination: null,\n  order: [] // report parts in the order the student added them\n};\n\nconst els = {};\nlet flashTimer = null;\n\nfunction getEl(id) {\n  const el = document.getElementById(id);\n  if (!el) {\n    throw new Error(`Missing element: ${id}`);\n  }\n  return el;\n}\n\nfunction getDestination(id) {\n  const found = COPY.destinations.find((dest) => dest.id === id);\n  if (!found) {\n    throw new Error(`Unknown destination: ${id}`);\n  }\n  return found;\n}\n\nfunction hasPart(part) {\n  return state.order.includes(part);\n}\n\nfunction formatNumber(value) {\n  return new Intl.NumberFormat().format(value);\n}\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Setup\n   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */\n\nfunction cacheElements() {\n  els.widget = getEl('widget');\n  els.banner = getEl('error-banner');\n  els.announcer = getEl('announcer');\n  els.picker = getEl('picker');\n  els.pickerOptions = getEl('picker-options');\n  els.frameUrl = getEl('frame-url');\n  els.frameBody = getEl('frame-body');\n  els.highlight = getEl('highlight');\n  els.pin = getEl('pin');\n  els.cluster = getEl('cluster');\n  els.ghost = getEl('reply-ghost');\n  els.headline = getEl('reply-headline');\n  els.lines = getEl('reply-lines');\n  els.fix = getEl('reply-fix');\n  els.fixLabel = getEl('fix-label');\n  els.fixText = getEl('fix-text');\n  els.lineTemplate = getEl('reply-line-template');\n\n  els.mocks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.mock'));\n  els.chips = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.chip'));\n  els.arms = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.arm'));\n\n  els.slots = {};\n  els.notes = {};\n  PARTS.forEach((part) => {\n    els.slots[part] = document.querySelector(`.slot[data-part=\"${part}\"]`);\n    els.notes[part] = document.querySelector(`.note[data-part=\"${part}\"]`);\n    if (!els.slots[part] || !els.notes[part]) {\n      throw new Error(`Missing slot or note for ${part}`);\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nfunction buildPicker() {\n  COPY.destinations.forEach((dest) => {\n    const button = document.createElement('button');\n    button.type = 'button';\n    button.className = 'segment';\n    button.dataset.destination = dest.id;\n    button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');\n    button.textContent = dest.label;\n    button.addEventListener('click', () => setDestination(dest.id, true));\n    els.pickerOptions.appendChild(button);\n  });\n  els.picker.hidden = !CONFIG.showDestinationPicker;\n}\n\nfunction bindEvents() {\n  els.chips.forEach((chip) => {\n    chip.addEventListener('click', () => togglePart(chip.dataset.part));\n  });\n\n  window.addEventListener('resize', positionOverlays);\n  if ('ResizeObserver' in window) {\n    new ResizeObserver(positionOverlays).observe(els.frameBody);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction init() {\n  try {\n    cacheElements();\n    els.fixLabel.textContent = COPY.ui.fixLabel;\n    buildPicker();\n    bindEvents();\n    setDestination(CONFIG.defaultDestination, false);\n  } catch (error) {\n    showError(COPY.ui.loadError);\n    console.error(error);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction showError(message) {\n  const banner = document.getElementById('error-banner');\n  if (banner) {\n    banner.textContent = message;\n    banner.hidden = false;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Destination\n   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */\n\nfunction setDestination(id, shouldAnnounce) {\n  const dest = getDestination(id);\n  state.destination = dest;\n  state.order = [];\n\n  els.widget.dataset.destination = dest.id;\n  els.mocks.forEach((mock) => {\n    mock.hidden = mock.dataset.mock !== dest.id;\n  });\n  Array.from(els.pickerOptions.children).forEach((button) => {\n    button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(button.dataset.destination === dest.id));\n  });\n  els.frameUrl.textContent = dest.url;\n\n  PARTS.forEach((part) => {\n    fillWords(els.slots[part].querySelector('.slot-text'), dest.report[part]);\n    els.notes[part].querySelector('.note-text').textContent = dest.notes[part];\n  });\n\n  buildGhost(dest);\n  els.lines.replaceChildren();\n  render(null, true);\n\n  if (shouldAnnounce) {\n    announce(COPY.ui.announceDestination({ picture: dest.picture }));\n  }\n}\n\nfunction fillWords(container, text) {\n  container.replaceChildren();\n  text.split(' ').forEach((word, index) => {\n    if (index > 0) {\n      container.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n    }\n    const span = document.createElement('span');\n    span.className = 'word';\n    span.style.setProperty('--i', String(index));\n    span.textContent = word;\n    container.appendChild(span);\n  });\n}\n\n// A hidden copy of the longest reply keeps the card height steady.\nfunction buildGhost(dest) {\n  const longest = COPY.levels.reduce((a, b) => (b.length > a.length ? b : a));\n\n  const headline = document.createElement('p');\n  headline.className = 'reply-headline';\n  headline.textContent = longest;\n\n  const list = document.createElement('ul');\n  list.className = 'reply-lines';\n  PARTS.forEach((part) => list.appendChild(makeLine(part, dest.reply[part], false)));\n\n  const fix = document.createElement('div');\n  fix.className = 'reply-fix';\n  const icon = makeIcon('fix');\n  const text = document.createElement('p');\n  text.className = 'reply-fix-text';\n  const label = document.createElement('strong');\n  label.className = 'fix-label';\n  label.textContent = COPY.ui.fixLabel;\n  const body = document.createElement('span');\n  body.textContent = dest.fix;\n  text.append(label, document.createTextNode(' '), body);\n  fix.append(icon, text);\n\n  els.ghost.replaceChildren(headline, list, fix);\n}\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Interaction\n   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */\n\nfunction togglePart(part) {\n  const index = state.order.indexOf(part);\n  const adding = index === -1;\n  if (adding) {\n    state.order.push(part);\n  } else {\n    state.order.splice(index, 1);\n  }\n\n  render(adding ? part : null, false);\n\n  if (adding) {\n    flash(part);\n  }\n  announce(describeChange(part, adding));\n}\n\nfunction describeChange(part, adding) {\n  const dest = state.destination;\n  const chip = els.chips.find((item) => item.dataset.part === part);\n  const label = chip.textContent.trim();\n  const headline = COPY.levels[state.order.length];\n\n  if (!adding) {\n    return COPY.ui.announceRemoved({ label, headline });\n  }\n  if (state.order.length === PARTS.length) {\n    return COPY.ui.announceAddedWithFix({ label, headline, line: dest.reply[part], fix: dest.fix });\n  }\n  return COPY.ui.announceAdded({ label, headline, line: dest.reply[part] });\n}\n\nfunction announce(message) {\n  els.announcer.textContent = '';\n  window.setTimeout(() => {\n    els.announcer.textContent = message;\n  }, CONFIG.announceDelayMs);\n}\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------------\n   Rendering\n   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */\n\nfunction render(newPart, snap) {\n  renderReport();\n  renderReply(newPart);\n  renderCluster();\n  renderPage(snap);\n}\n\nfunction renderReport() {\n  els.chips.forEach((chip) => {\n    chip.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(hasPart(chip.dataset.part)));\n  });\n  PARTS.forEach((part) => {\n    const slot = els.slots[part];\n    const filled = hasPart(part);\n    slot.dataset.filled = String(filled);\n    slot.querySelector('.slot-text').setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(!filled));\n    slot.querySelector('.slot-empty').hidden = filled;\n  });\n}\n\nfunction renderReply(newPart) {\n  const dest = state.destination;\n  const count = state.order.length;\n\n  els.widget.dataset.level = String(count);\n  els.headline.textContent = COPY.levels[count];\n\n  els.lines.querySelectorAll('.reply-line').forEach((line) => {\n    if (!hasPart(line.dataset.part)) {\n      line.remove();\n    }\n  });\n  state.order.forEach((part) => {\n    if (!els.lines.querySelector(`.reply-line[data-part=\"${part}\"]`)) {\n      els.lines.appendChild(makeLine(part, dest.reply[part], part === newPart));\n    }\n  });\n\n  const showFix = count === PARTS.length;\n  const fixWasHidden = els.fix.hidden;\n  els.fix.hidden = !showFix;\n  els.fixText.textContent = dest.fix;\n  if (showFix && fixWasHidden) {\n    els.fix.classList.remove('is-new');\n    void els.fix.offsetWidth;\n    els.fix.classList.add('is-new');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction makeLine(part, text, isNew) {\n  const line = els.lineTemplate.content.firstElementChild.cloneNode(true);\n  line.dataset.part = part;\n  line.querySelector('use').setAttribute('href', `#icon-${part}`);\n  line.querySelector('.reply-line-text').textContent = text;\n  if (isNew) {\n    line.classList.add('is-new');\n  }\n  return line;\n}\n\nfunction makeIcon(name) {\n  const svgNs = 'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\n  const svg = document.createElementNS(svgNs, 'svg');\n  svg.setAttribute('class', 'icon');\n  svg.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\n  svg.setAttribute('focusable', 'false');\n  const use = document.createElementNS(svgNs, 'use');\n  use.setAttribute('href', `#icon-${name}`);\n  svg.appendChild(use);\n  return svg;\n}\n\nfunction renderCluster() {\n  els.arms.forEach((arm) => {\n    arm.dataset.lit = String(hasPart(arm.dataset.part));\n  });\n  els.cluster.setAttribute(\n    'aria-label',\n    COPY.ui.clusterLabel({ count: formatNumber(state.order.length), total: formatNumber(PARTS.length) })\n  );\n}\n\nfunction renderPage(snap) {\n  const dest = state.destination;\n\n  els.frameBody.dataset.happened = String(hasPart('happened'));\n  PARTS.forEach((part) => {\n    els.notes[part].dataset.on = String(hasPart(part));\n  });\n  els.frameBody.setAttribute('aria-label', hasPart('where') ? dest.pictureWhere : dest.picture);\n\n  if (snap) {\n    els.pin.classList.add('no-anim');\n  }\n  positionOverlays();\n  if (snap) {\n    void els.pin.offsetWidth;\n    els.pin.classList.remove('no-anim');\n  }\n}\n\nfunction getTarget() {\n  const mock = els.mocks.find((item) => !item.hidden);\n  return mock ? mock.querySelector('[data-target]') : null;\n}\n\nfunction clamp(value, min, max) {\n  return Math.min(Math.max(value, min), max);\n}\n\nfunction positionOverlays() {\n  const target = getTarget();\n  if (!target) {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const bodyRect = els.frameBody.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const rect = target.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const left = rect.left - bodyRect.left;\n  const top = rect.top - bodyRect.top;\n  const pad = 4;\n  const style = els.frameBody.style;\n\n  style.setProperty('--hl-x', `${left - pad}px`);\n  style.setProperty('--hl-y', `${top - pad}px`);\n  style.setProperty('--hl-w', `${rect.width + pad * 2}px`);\n  style.setProperty('--hl-h', `${rect.height + pad * 2}px`);\n\n  let pinX = bodyRect.width - 20;\n  let pinY = 20;\n  if (hasPart('where')) {\n    pinX = clamp(left + rect.width + 6, 16, bodyRect.width - 16);\n    pinY = clamp(top - 2, 16, bodyRect.height - 16);\n  }\n  style.setProperty('--pin-x', `${pinX}px`);\n  style.setProperty('--pin-y', `${pinY}px`);\n}\n\nfunction flash(part) {\n  const highlight = els.highlight;\n  highlight.dataset.part = part;\n  highlight.classList.remove('is-flashing');\n  void highlight.offsetWidth;\n  highlight.classList.add('is-flashing');\n  window.clearTimeout(flashTimer);\n  flashTimer = window.setTimeout(() => highlight.classList.remove('is-flashing'), CONFIG.flashMs);\n}\n\ninit();\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "contents": "/*\n * CADS tokens\n * Copied from the CADS runtime (manifest 0.1.0), light theme. Only tokens that\n * this stylesheet uses, and the tokens they refer to, are included.\n * Do not edit values here; change the component styles below instead.\n */\n\n:root {\n  /* Palette */\n  --brand-purple-20: #aca8ea;\n  --brand-purple-50: #4c42cf;\n  --brand-purple-80: #2b1e9f;\n  --brand-purple-95: #1f1976;\n  --brand-orange-5: #ffe3ce;\n  --brand-orange-30: #ffa868;\n  --brand-pink-30: #f07fb0;\n  --neutral-base-black: #121212;\n  --neutral-base-white: #ffffff;\n  --neutral-gray-5: #f1f2f4;\n  --neutral-gray-10: #e1e3e6;\n  --neutral-gray-20: #d3d6da;\n  --neutral-gray-40: #9ea5ad;\n  --neutral-gray-70: #596069;\n  --neutral-gray-80: #4b5258;\n  --neutral-gray-90: #363b40;\n  --sentiment-error-5: #ffdada;\n  --sentiment-error-20: #f69898;\n  --sentiment-error-50: #eb1414;\n  --sentiment-error-70: #b30f0f;\n  --sentiment-information-5: #d5efff;\n  --sentiment-information-30: #6fcaff;\n  --sentiment-information-70: #1570d1;\n  --sentiment-information-90: #0b43a3;\n  --sentiment-success-5: #d8ffdc;\n  --sentiment-success-30: #7cdb87;\n  --sentiment-success-70: #258830;\n  --sentiment-success-90: #17541e;\n  --sentiment-warning-30: #ffd35c;\n\n  /* Color roles (light theme) */\n  --background-neutral-primary: var(--neutral-base-white);\n  --background-neutral-secondary: var(--neutral-gray-5);\n  --background-neutral-tertiary: var(--neutral-gray-10);\n  --background-neutral-quaternary: var(--neutral-gray-20);\n  --background-neutral-octonary: var(--neutral-gray-80);\n  --background-neutral-black-fixed: var(--neutral-base-black);\n  --background-brand-primary: var(--brand-purple-50);\n  --background-brand-mid: var(--brand-purple-20);\n  --background-error-primary: var(--sentiment-error-50);\n  --background-error-light: var(--sentiment-error-5);\n  --background-warning-mid: var(--sentiment-warning-30);\n  --background-success-primary: var(--sentiment-success-70);\n  --background-success-light: var(--sentiment-success-5);\n  --background-success-mid: var(--sentiment-success-30);\n  --background-info-primary: var(--sentiment-information-70);\n  --background-info-light: var(--sentiment-information-5);\n  --background-info-mid: var(--sentiment-information-30);\n  --background-selected-primary: var(--brand-purple-80);\n  --background-selected-strong: var(--brand-purple-95);\n  --background-accent-orange-light: var(--brand-orange-5);\n  --background-accent-orange-mid: var(--brand-orange-30);\n  --background-accent-pink-mid: var(--brand-pink-30);\n  --border-neutral-primary: var(--neutral-gray-20);\n  --border-neutral-secondary: var(--neutral-gray-40);\n  --border-neutral-solid: var(--neutral-base-black);\n  --border-neutral-white-fixed: var(--neutral-base-white);\n  --border-error-primary: var(--sentiment-error-50);\n  --border-error-mid: var(--sentiment-error-20);\n  --border-success-mid: var(--sentiment-success-30);\n  --border-info-mid: var(--sentiment-information-30);\n  --border-focused-primary: var(--brand-purple-50);\n  --border-selected-primary: var(--brand-purple-80);\n  --text-neutral-primary: var(--neutral-base-black);\n  --text-neutral-secondary: var(--neutral-gray-90);\n  --text-neutral-quaternary: var(--neutral-gray-70);\n  --text-neutral-placeholder: var(--neutral-gray-40);\n  --text-neutral-white-fixed: var(--neutral-base-white);\n  --text-error-secondary: var(--sentiment-error-70);\n  --text-success-primary: var(--sentiment-success-70);\n  --text-success-secondary: var(--sentiment-success-90);\n  --text-info-secondary: var(--sentiment-information-90);\n  --text-selected-primary: var(--sentiment-success-5);\n\n  /* Type */\n  --font-weight-semi-bold: 600;\n  --text-heading-lg: 1.75rem;\n  --text-heading-xs: 1.25rem;\n  --leading-heading-lg: 2.25rem;\n  --leading-heading-xs: 1.75rem;\n  --text-body-sm: .875rem;\n  --text-body-xs: .75rem;\n  --leading-body-sm: 1.375rem;\n  --leading-body-xs: 1.125rem;\n  --tracking-heading-display: -.01em;\n  --tracking-overline: .08em;\n\n  /* Shape, spacing and control sizes */\n  --shape-sm: .375rem;\n  --shape-md: .5rem;\n  --shape-lg: .625rem;\n  --shape-round: 62.4375rem;\n  --spacing-p-xxs: .5rem;\n  --spacing-p-xs: 1rem;\n  --control-height-small: 32px;\n\n  /* Motion */\n  --duration-short: .15s;\n  --duration-medium: .2s;\n  --easing-standard: cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1);\n  --easing-out: cubic-bezier(.23, 1, .32, 1);\n  --motion-press-scale: .97;\n  --motion-press-duration: .15s;\n  --motion-press-easing: cubic-bezier(.23, 1, .32, 1);\n  --motion-indicator-duration: .2s;\n  --motion-indicator-easing: cubic-bezier(.2, 0, 0, 1);\n  --transition-colors: background-color var(--duration-short) var(--easing-standard), color var(--duration-short) var(--easing-standard), border-color var(--duration-short) var(--easing-standard), box-shadow var(--duration-short) var(--easing-standard), opacity var(--duration-short) var(--easing-standard);\n\n  /* Approximated: Geist and Space Grotesk are not loaded in Web Lab, so each\n     stack falls back to system fonts. */\n  --font-family-main: \"Geist\", \"Noto Sans\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  --font-family-heading: \"Space Grotesk\", \"Geist\", \"Noto Sans\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  --font-family-mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n}\n\n/* Same reduced-motion overrides the CADS runtime ships. */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  :root {\n    --motion-press-duration: 0ms;\n    --motion-indicator-duration: 0.1s;\n    --motion-press-scale: 1;\n  }\n}\n\n/*\n * Component styles\n *\n * CADS (copied as-is): every custom property in the token block above comes\n * from the CADS runtime, light theme, and is used by name. Focus ring recipe\n * (2px gap + 2px --border-focused-primary), pressed-chip scale, selected-chip\n * colors and the connected segmented-button radii follow the CADS recipes.\n *\n * Rebuilt from the manifest: Chip (pill, selected tokens, semibold label),\n * SegmentedButton (connected segments, selected tokens, small control height),\n * Tag (the three notes under the sample page), Alert (the fix block and the\n * error banner), and the card header with an overline label (inspector\n * pattern from the UI patterns reference).\n *\n * Approximated: the CADS React components and Font Awesome are not available\n * in Web Lab, so each control is plain HTML and CSS. Chip padding, gap and\n * unselected border are estimates (small control height, --border-neutral-secondary).\n * Icons are small inline SVG drawings, not Font Awesome. Geist and Space\n * Grotesk are not loaded in Web Lab, so the font stacks fall back to system\n * fonts. The segmented control uses Tab and Enter or Space, not the CADS\n * arrow-key radio group. The sample page, wheel, console and node cluster are\n * custom art made only from CADS tokens.\n */\n\n*,\n*::before,\n*::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  background: var(--background-neutral-primary);\n  color: var(--text-neutral-primary);\n  font-family: var(--font-family-main);\n  font-size: var(--text-body-sm);\n  line-height: var(--leading-body-sm);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font: inherit;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.visually-hidden {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  margin: -1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  clip: rect(0 0 0 0);\n  clip-path: inset(50%);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n.sprite {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 0;\n  height: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.icon {\n  flex: none;\n  width: 1rem;\n  height: 1rem;\n  fill: none;\n  stroke: currentColor;\n  stroke-width: 2;\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\n}\n\n/* One accent set per report part, inherited by chips, notes, lines and nodes. */\n[data-part=\"expected\"] {\n  --part-bg: var(--background-success-light);\n  --part-fg: var(--text-success-secondary);\n  --part-border: var(--border-success-mid);\n  --part-accent: var(--background-success-primary);\n}\n\n[data-part=\"happened\"] {\n  --part-bg: var(--background-error-light);\n  --part-fg: var(--text-error-secondary);\n  --part-border: var(--border-error-mid);\n  --part-accent: var(--background-error-primary);\n}\n\n[data-part=\"where\"] {\n  --part-bg: var(--background-info-light);\n  --part-fg: var(--text-info-secondary);\n  --part-border: var(--border-info-mid);\n  --part-accent: var(--background-info-primary);\n}\n\n.overline {\n  font-size: var(--text-body-xs);\n  line-height: var(--leading-body-xs);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n  letter-spacing: var(--tracking-overline);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--text-neutral-quaternary);\n}\n\n/* Layout */\n\n.widget {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-p-xxs);\n  padding: var(--spacing-p-xxs) var(--spacing-p-xs) var(--spacing-p-xs);\n}\n\n.stage {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 4fr) minmax(0, 5fr);\n  gap: var(--spacing-p-xs);\n  align-items: stretch;\n}\n\n.side {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-p-xs);\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 48rem) {\n  .stage {\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n\n.error-banner {\n  padding: var(--spacing-p-xxs) var(--spacing-p-xs);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-error-mid);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-md);\n  background: var(--background-error-light);\n  color: var(--text-error-secondary);\n}\n\n/* Destination picker (author only) */\n\n.picker {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-p-xxs);\n}\n\n.segmented {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  max-width: 100%;\n}\n\n.segment {\n  height: var(--control-height-small);\n  margin: 0;\n  padding-inline: 0.75rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-neutral-secondary);\n  background: var(--background-neutral-primary);\n  color: var(--text-neutral-primary);\n  font-size: var(--text-body-sm);\n  line-height: var(--leading-body-sm);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: var(--transition-colors);\n}\n\n.segment + .segment {\n  margin-inline-start: -1px;\n}\n\n.segment:first-child {\n  border-start-start-radius: var(--shape-sm);\n  border-end-start-radius: var(--shape-sm);\n}\n\n.segment:last-child {\n  border-start-end-radius: var(--shape-sm);\n  border-end-end-radius: var(--shape-sm);\n}\n\n.segment:hover {\n  background: var(--background-neutral-tertiary);\n}\n\n.segment[aria-pressed=\"true\"] {\n  position: relative;\n  border-color: var(--border-selected-primary);\n  background: var(--background-selected-primary);\n  color: var(--text-selected-primary);\n}\n\n.segment[aria-pressed=\"true\"]:hover {\n  background: var(--background-selected-strong);\n}\n\n.segment:focus-visible {\n  position: relative;\n  outline: 2px solid var(--border-focused-primary);\n  outline-offset: -2px;\n}\n\n/* Sample page frame */\n\n.frame {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  min-width: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-neutral-primary);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-lg);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--background-neutral-primary);\n}\n\n.frame-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  height: 2rem;\n  padding-inline: var(--spacing-p-xxs);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-neutral-primary);\n  background: var(--background-neutral-secondary);\n}\n\n.frame-url {\n  padding-inline: 0.75rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-neutral-primary);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-round);\n  background: var(--background-neutral-primary);\n  color: var(--text-neutral-quaternary);\n  font-size: var(--text-body-xs);\n  line-height: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.frame-body {\n  position: relative;\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\n  min-height: 15rem;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.mock {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  padding: var(--spacing-p-xs);\n}\n\n.mock-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-family-heading);\n  font-size: var(--text-heading-xs);\n  line-height: var(--leading-heading-xs);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n  letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading-display);\n}\n\n.mock-button {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  height: var(--control-height-small);\n  padding-inline: 1.25rem;\n  border-radius: var(--shape-sm);\n  background: var(--background-brand-primary);\n  color: var(--text-neutral-white-fixed);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n}\n\n.bar {\n  display: block;\n  height: 0.625rem;\n  border-radius: var(--shape-round);\n  background: var(--background-neutral-tertiary);\n}\n\n.bar-short {\n  width: 2.5rem;\n}\n\n.bar-mid {\n  width: 55%;\n}\n\n.bar-wide {\n  width: 80%;\n}\n\n/* Spin button page */\n\n.wheel {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 8rem;\n  height: 8rem;\n  border: 2px solid var(--border-neutral-secondary);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-round);\n  background: conic-gradient(\n    var(--background-accent-orange-mid) 0 60deg,\n    var(--background-accent-pink-mid) 60deg 120deg,\n    var(--background-brand-mid) 120deg 180deg,\n    var(--background-warning-mid) 180deg 240deg,\n    var(--background-success-mid) 240deg 300deg,\n    var(--background-info-mid) 300deg 360deg\n  );\n}\n\n.wheel-hub {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  width: 1.5rem;\n  height: 1.5rem;\n  margin: auto;\n  border: 2px solid var(--border-neutral-secondary);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-round);\n  background: var(--background-neutral-primary);\n}\n\n.wheel-pointer {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -0.5rem;\n  left: calc(50% - 0.5rem);\n  border-inline: 0.5rem solid transparent;\n  border-top: 0.875rem solid var(--border-neutral-solid);\n}\n\n/* Headline page */\n\n.mock-bakery {\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  justify-content: flex-start;\n  background: var(--background-accent-orange-light);\n}\n\n.bakery-nav {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  align-self: stretch;\n  gap: var(--spacing-p-xxs);\n}\n\n.bakery-name {\n  margin-inline-end: auto;\n  font-size: var(--text-body-sm);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n  color: var(--text-neutral-secondary);\n}\n\n.cut-title {\n  width: 13rem;\n  max-width: 100%;\n  margin-block-start: 0.5rem;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  font-family: var(--font-family-heading);\n  font-size: var(--text-heading-lg);\n  line-height: var(--leading-heading-lg);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n  letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading-display);\n}\n\n.photo {\n  align-self: stretch;\n  flex: none;\n  height: 5rem;\n  border-radius: var(--shape-md);\n  background: var(--background-accent-orange-mid);\n}\n\n/* Sign-up page */\n\n.books {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.book {\n  display: block;\n  width: 3rem;\n  border-radius: var(--shape-sm);\n}\n\n.book-a {\n  height: 4.25rem;\n  background: var(--background-brand-mid);\n}\n\n.book-b {\n  height: 5rem;\n  background: var(--background-accent-pink-mid);\n}\n\n.book-c {\n  height: 3.75rem;\n  background: var(--background-success-mid);\n}\n\n/* Console page */\n\n.mock-greeting {\n  align-items: stretch;\n  justify-content: flex-start;\n  gap: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.greeting-page {\n  display: flex;\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  padding: var(--spacing-p-xs);\n}\n\n.greeting-text {\n  font-family: var(--font-family-heading);\n  font-size: var(--text-heading-lg);\n  line-height: var(--leading-heading-lg);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n}\n\n.name-field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.125rem;\n}\n\n.field-label {\n  font-size: var(--text-body-xs);\n  line-height: var(--leading-body-xs);\n  color: var(--text-neutral-quaternary);\n}\n\n.field-input {\n  min-width: 8rem;\n  padding: 0.25rem 0.625rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-neutral-secondary);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-sm);\n}\n\n.console-panel {\n  padding: var(--spacing-p-xxs) 0.75rem 0.75rem;\n  background: var(--background-neutral-black-fixed);\n  color: var(--text-neutral-white-fixed);\n  font-family: var(--font-family-mono);\n  font-size: var(--text-body-xs);\n  line-height: var(--leading-body-xs);\n}\n\n.console-head {\n  margin-block-end: 0.375rem;\n  color: var(--text-neutral-placeholder);\n  letter-spacing: var(--tracking-overline);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.console-line {\n  display: flex;\n  margin-inline-end: 1.5rem;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 0.375rem;\n  padding: 0.25rem 0.375rem;\n  border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--border-error-primary);\n  background: var(--background-neutral-octonary);\n}\n\n.console-line .icon {\n  width: 0.875rem;\n  height: 0.875rem;\n  margin-top: 0.125rem;\n  color: var(--border-error-mid);\n}\n\n.console-file {\n  margin-inline-start: auto;\n  color: var(--border-neutral-primary);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n/* Overlays on the sample page */\n\n.frame-body[data-happened=\"true\"] [data-target] {\n  outline: 2px dashed var(--border-error-primary);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.highlight {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: var(--hl-y, 0);\n  left: var(--hl-x, 0);\n  width: var(--hl-w, 0);\n  height: var(--hl-h, 0);\n  border: 3px solid var(--part-accent);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-md);\n  opacity: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.highlight.is-flashing {\n  opacity: 1;\n  animation: flash 0.9s var(--easing-standard);\n}\n\n.pin {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  z-index: 2;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 1.5rem;\n  height: 1.5rem;\n  border: 2px solid var(--border-neutral-white-fixed);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-round);\n  background: var(--background-error-primary);\n  color: var(--text-neutral-white-fixed);\n  transform: translate(calc(var(--pin-x, 0px) - 50%), calc(var(--pin-y, 0px) - 50%));\n  transition: transform var(--motion-indicator-duration) var(--motion-indicator-easing);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.pin.no-anim {\n  transition: none;\n}\n\n.pin .icon {\n  width: 0.75rem;\n  height: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.pin::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: -2px;\n  border: 2px solid var(--border-error-primary);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-round);\n  animation: pin-pulse 1.8s var(--easing-out) infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes pin-pulse {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0.8;\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(1.9);\n  }\n}\n\n@keyframes flash {\n  0% {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(1.12);\n  }\n  25% {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n  100% {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n}\n\n/* Notes under the sample page (Tag recipe) */\n\n.notes {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.375rem;\n  padding: var(--spacing-p-xxs);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-neutral-primary);\n  background: var(--background-neutral-secondary);\n}\n\n.note {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n  height: 1.5rem;\n  padding-inline: 0.5rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--part-border);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-sm);\n  background: var(--part-bg);\n  color: var(--part-fg);\n  font-size: var(--text-body-xs);\n  line-height: var(--leading-body-xs);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(4px);\n  transition: opacity var(--duration-medium) var(--easing-out), transform var(--duration-medium) var(--easing-out);\n}\n\n.note[data-on=\"true\"] {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: none;\n}\n\n.note .icon {\n  width: 0.75rem;\n  height: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n/* Cards */\n\n.card {\n  min-width: 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-neutral-primary);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-md);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--background-neutral-primary);\n}\n\n.card-head {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  height: 2rem;\n  padding-inline: var(--spacing-p-xs);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-neutral-primary);\n  background: var(--background-neutral-secondary);\n}\n\n.card-body {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  padding: 0.75rem var(--spacing-p-xs);\n}\n\n.card-head .overline {\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* Chips */\n\n.chips {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.375rem;\n}\n\n.chip {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.375rem;\n  height: var(--control-height-small);\n  margin: 0;\n  padding-inline: 0.625rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-neutral-secondary);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-round);\n  background: var(--background-neutral-primary);\n  color: var(--text-neutral-primary);\n  font-size: var(--text-body-sm);\n  line-height: var(--leading-body-sm);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: var(--transition-colors), transform var(--motion-press-duration) var(--motion-press-easing);\n}\n\n.chip .icon {\n  color: var(--part-accent);\n}\n\n.chip:hover {\n  background: var(--background-neutral-tertiary);\n}\n\n.chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"] {\n  border-color: transparent;\n  background: var(--background-selected-primary);\n  color: var(--text-selected-primary);\n}\n\n.chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"] .icon {\n  color: inherit;\n}\n\n.chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"]:hover {\n  background: var(--background-selected-strong);\n}\n\n.chip:active {\n  transform: scale(var(--motion-press-scale));\n}\n\n.chip:focus-visible {\n  outline: none;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--background-neutral-primary), 0 0 0 4px var(--border-focused-primary);\n}\n\n/* Report slots */\n\n.slots {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 0.375rem;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.slot {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.slot .icon {\n  margin-top: 0.1875rem;\n  color: var(--part-accent);\n  transition: color var(--duration-medium) var(--easing-out);\n}\n\n.slot[data-filled=\"false\"] .icon {\n  color: var(--border-neutral-secondary);\n}\n\n.slot-text {\n  min-width: 0;\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n}\n\n.word {\n  border-radius: 0.25rem;\n  transition:\n    color var(--duration-medium) var(--easing-out) calc(var(--i, 0) * 30ms),\n    background-color var(--duration-medium) var(--easing-out) calc(var(--i, 0) * 30ms);\n}\n\n.slot[data-filled=\"false\"] .word {\n  background: var(--background-neutral-tertiary);\n  color: transparent;\n}\n\n/* Reply */\n\n.reply-body {\n  position: relative;\n  padding: var(--spacing-p-xs);\n}\n\n.cluster {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: var(--spacing-p-xxs);\n  inset-inline-end: var(--spacing-p-xs);\n  width: 5.5rem;\n  height: 3.5rem;\n}\n\n.reply-text {\n  display: grid;\n}\n\n.reply-ghost,\n.reply-live {\n  grid-area: 1 / 1;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n.reply-ghost {\n  visibility: hidden;\n}\n\n.reply-headline {\n  min-height: 3rem;\n  padding-inline-end: 6.5rem;\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n}\n\n.reply-lines {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 0.375rem;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.reply-line {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  color: var(--text-neutral-secondary);\n}\n\n.reply-line .icon {\n  margin-top: 0.1875rem;\n  color: var(--part-accent);\n}\n\n.reply-fix {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  margin-top: 0.625rem;\n  padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-success-mid);\n  border-radius: var(--shape-md);\n  background: var(--background-success-light);\n}\n\n.reply-fix .icon {\n  margin-top: 0.1875rem;\n  color: var(--text-success-primary);\n}\n\n.fix-label {\n  color: var(--text-success-secondary);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semi-bold);\n}\n\n.is-new {\n  animation: line-in var(--duration-medium) var(--easing-out);\n}\n\n@keyframes line-in {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(6px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/* Node cluster: opacity and transform only */\n\n.edge-dim {\n  stroke: var(--border-neutral-primary);\n  stroke-width: 1.5;\n}\n\n.node-dim {\n  fill: var(--background-neutral-quaternary);\n}\n\n.node-center {\n  fill: var(--background-selected-primary);\n}\n\n.edge-lit {\n  stroke: var(--part-accent);\n  stroke-width: 2;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: opacity var(--duration-medium) var(--easing-out);\n}\n\n.node-lit {\n  fill: var(--part-accent);\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: scale(0.4);\n  transform-box: fill-box;\n  transform-origin: center;\n  transition: opacity var(--duration-medium) var(--easing-out), transform var(--duration-medium) var(--easing-out);\n}\n\n.edge-far,\n.node-far {\n  transition-delay: 0.12s;\n}\n\n.arm[data-lit=\"true\"] .edge-lit,\n.arm[data-lit=\"true\"] .node-lit {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.arm[data-lit=\"true\"] .node-lit {\n  transform: scale(1);\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .pin::before,\n  .is-new {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n\n  .highlight.is-flashing {\n    animation: none;\n  }\n\n  .pin,\n  .note,\n  .word,\n  .slot .icon,\n  .edge-lit,\n  .node-lit,\n  .chip {\n    transition: none;\n  }\n\n  .word,\n  .edge-far,\n  .node-far {\n    transition-delay: 0s;\n  }\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Write a Bug Report</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script src=\"script.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <svg class=\"sprite\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n    <symbol id=\"icon-expected\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/>\n      <path d=\"M8 12.5l2.7 2.7L16 9.5\"/>\n    </symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"icon-happened\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path d=\"M12 3.5l9.5 16.5h-19z\"/>\n      <path d=\"M12 10v4.5\"/>\n      <path d=\"M12 17.4h.01\"/>\n    </symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"icon-where\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path d=\"M12 21s-6.5-5.6-6.5-11a6.5 6.5 0 0113 0c0 5.4-6.5 11-6.5 11z\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.3\"/>\n    </symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"icon-fix\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path d=\"M12 3l2.2 6.3L21 12l-6.8 2.7L12 21l-2.2-6.3L3 12l6.8-2.7z\"/>\n    </symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"icon-exclaim\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path d=\"M12 6v8\"/>\n      <path d=\"M12 18h.01\"/>\n    </symbol>\n    <symbol id=\"icon-error\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/>\n      <path d=\"M9 9l6 6M15 9l-6 6\"/>\n    </symbol>\n  </svg>\n\n  <main class=\"widget\" id=\"widget\" data-destination=\"\" data-level=\"0\">\n    <h1 class=\"visually-hidden\">Write a bug report</h1>\n\n    <p class=\"error-banner\" id=\"error-banner\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p>\n    <p class=\"visually-hidden\" id=\"announcer\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n\n    <div class=\"picker\" id=\"picker\">\n      <span class=\"overline\" id=\"picker-label\">Broken page</span>\n      <div class=\"segmented\" id=\"picker-options\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"picker-label\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stage\">\n\n      <section class=\"frame\" aria-label=\"Sample page\">\n        <div class=\"frame-bar\">\n          <span class=\"frame-url\" id=\"frame-url\"></span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"frame-body\" id=\"frame-body\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\">\n\n          <div class=\"mock mock-spin\" data-mock=\"spin\" hidden>\n            <p class=\"mock-title\">Prize Wheel</p>\n            <div class=\"wheel\">\n              <span class=\"wheel-pointer\"></span>\n              <span class=\"wheel-hub\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"mock-button\" data-target>Spin</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mock mock-bakery\" data-mock=\"headline\" hidden>\n            <div class=\"bakery-nav\">\n              <span class=\"bakery-name\">Maple Street Bakery</span>\n              <span class=\"bar bar-short\"></span>\n              <span class=\"bar bar-short\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"cut-title\" data-target>Fresh bread baked every morning</p>\n            <span class=\"bar bar-wide\"></span>\n            <span class=\"bar bar-mid\"></span>\n            <span class=\"photo\"></span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mock mock-club\" data-mock=\"signup\" hidden>\n            <p class=\"mock-title\">Reading Club</p>\n            <div class=\"books\">\n              <span class=\"book book-a\"></span>\n              <span class=\"book book-b\"></span>\n              <span class=\"book book-c\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"bar bar-wide\"></span>\n            <span class=\"mock-button\" data-target>Join</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mock mock-greeting\" data-mock=\"console\" hidden>\n            <div class=\"greeting-page\">\n              <p class=\"greeting-text\">Hi, !</p>\n              <div class=\"name-field\">\n                <span class=\"field-label\">Your name</span>\n                <span class=\"field-input\">Sam</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"console-panel\">\n              <p class=\"console-head\">Console</p>\n              <p class=\"console-line\" data-target>\n                <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-error\"></use></svg>\n                <span>TypeError: Cannot read properties of null (reading 'value')</span>\n                <span class=\"console-file\">script.js:12</span>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <span class=\"highlight\" id=\"highlight\"></span>\n          <span class=\"pin\" id=\"pin\">\n            <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-exclaim\"></use></svg>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"notes\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"note\" data-part=\"expected\" data-on=\"false\">\n            <svg class=\"icon\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-expected\"></use></svg>\n            <span class=\"note-text\"></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"note\" data-part=\"happened\" data-on=\"false\">\n            <svg class=\"icon\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-happened\"></use></svg>\n            <span class=\"note-text\"></span>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"note\" data-part=\"where\" data-on=\"false\">\n            <svg class=\"icon\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-where\"></use></svg>\n            <span class=\"note-text\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"side\">\n\n        <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"report-title\">\n          <div class=\"card-head\">\n            <h2 class=\"overline\" id=\"report-title\">Bug report</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"card-body\">\n            <div class=\"chips\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-part=\"expected\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n                <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-expected\"></use></svg>\n                <span>What I expected</span>\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-part=\"happened\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n                <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-happened\"></use></svg>\n                <span>What happened</span>\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-part=\"where\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n                <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-where\"></use></svg>\n                <span>Where</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <ul class=\"slots\">\n              <li class=\"slot\" data-part=\"expected\" data-filled=\"false\">\n                <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-expected\"></use></svg>\n                <p class=\"slot-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></p>\n                <span class=\"visually-hidden slot-empty\">Not added yet</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"slot\" data-part=\"happened\" data-filled=\"false\">\n                <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-happened\"></use></svg>\n                <p class=\"slot-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></p>\n                <span class=\"visually-hidden slot-empty\">Not added yet</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"slot\" data-part=\"where\" data-filled=\"false\">\n                <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-where\"></use></svg>\n                <p class=\"slot-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></p>\n                <span class=\"visually-hidden slot-empty\">Not added yet</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"reply-title\">\n          <div class=\"card-head\">\n            <h2 class=\"overline\" id=\"reply-title\">Reply</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"reply-body\">\n            <svg class=\"cluster\" id=\"cluster\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 76\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\">\n              <g class=\"arm\" data-part=\"expected\" data-lit=\"false\">\n                <line class=\"edge-dim\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"20\"/>\n                <line class=\"edge-dim\" x1=\"36\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"12\"/>\n                <line class=\"edge-lit edge-near\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"20\"/>\n                <line class=\"edge-lit edge-far\" x1=\"36\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"12\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-dim\" cx=\"36\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5.5\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-dim\" cx=\"13\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.5\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-lit node-near\" cx=\"36\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5.5\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-lit node-far\" cx=\"13\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.5\"/>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"arm\" data-part=\"happened\" data-lit=\"false\">\n                <line class=\"edge-dim\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"20\"/>\n                <line class=\"edge-dim\" x1=\"84\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"107\" y2=\"12\"/>\n                <line class=\"edge-lit edge-near\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"20\"/>\n                <line class=\"edge-lit edge-far\" x1=\"84\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"107\" y2=\"12\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-dim\" cx=\"84\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5.5\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-dim\" cx=\"107\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.5\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-lit node-near\" cx=\"84\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5.5\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-lit node-far\" cx=\"107\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.5\"/>\n              </g>\n              <g class=\"arm\" data-part=\"where\" data-lit=\"false\">\n                <line class=\"edge-dim\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"53\"/>\n                <line class=\"edge-dim\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"53\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"66\"/>\n                <line class=\"edge-lit edge-near\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"53\"/>\n                <line class=\"edge-lit edge-far\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"53\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"66\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-dim\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"53\" r=\"5.5\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-dim\" cx=\"78\" cy=\"66\" r=\"4.5\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-lit node-near\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"53\" r=\"5.5\"/>\n                <circle class=\"node-lit node-far\" cx=\"78\" cy=\"66\" r=\"4.5\"/>\n              </g>\n              <circle class=\"node-center\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"32\" r=\"6.5\"/>\n            </svg>\n\n            <div class=\"reply-text\">\n              <div class=\"reply-ghost\" id=\"reply-ghost\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n              <div class=\"reply-live\" id=\"reply-live\">\n                <p class=\"reply-headline\" id=\"reply-headline\"></p>\n                <ul class=\"reply-lines\" id=\"reply-lines\"></ul>\n                <div class=\"reply-fix\" id=\"reply-fix\" hidden>\n                  <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-fix\"></use></svg>\n                  <p class=\"reply-fix-text\">\n                    <strong class=\"fix-label\" id=\"fix-label\"></strong>\n                    <span id=\"fix-text\"></span>\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <template id=\"reply-line-template\">\n    <li class=\"reply-line\">\n      <svg class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#icon-expected\"></use></svg>\n      <span class=\"reply-line-text\"></span>\n    </li>\n  </template>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "1",
        "2",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    "long_instructions": "###Fix the Bug Report\r\nSee how the details in a bug report change the help you get back.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Read the reply. Could the helper fix the problem yet?\r\n2. Tap the chips to add parts to the report. Watch the reply and the sample page change. Tap a chip again to take it out.\r\n3. Try different combinations of chips. Which ones made the reply most helpful?\r\n\r\n**Reflect & Discuss:**\r\n\r\nWhen one part was missing, what did the helper still not know?\r\nHow could you use this when you ask an AI to help fix your own page?\r\n\r\n**Remember:** The clearer your report, the more helpful the reply.",
